FluxDroid
=========

Realistic custom virtual Android phones built on AOSP Cuttlefish: a coherent custom device
identity and hardware profile, an instance manager (fluxctl), and a realism audit that measures
what an ordinary app can observe.

Status: planning. See docs/working/fluxdroid-plan.md.
Agents: see AGENTS.md.

Out of scope: forging attestation or bypassing Play Integrity / SafetyNet, reusing certified
retail fingerprints or extracted keys, and copying real device identifiers.
